					"content": "嗯，現在四篇故事都集齊了，五歌仙的故事也終於徹底完整了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400570512,
					"content": "是其他人後來加上的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400570513
					]
				}
			]
